---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="About - Ishan Mishra" description="Background, education, and interests of Ishan Mishra.">
  <section class="page-intro page-shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT / BACKGROUND</p>
    <h1>I like turning data into <span class="serif-italic">something useful.</span></h1>
    <p class="intro-lede">I'm a Master of Information Systems Management student at Carnegie Mellon's Heinz College, with a background in clinical systems, data pipelines, and analytics.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="about-body section-shell">
    <div class="about-label"><span class="eyebrow">A SHORT INTRODUCTION</span></div>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p>I studied Information Systems and Data Science at the University of Wisconsin-Madison, and I'm now pursuing my master's in the Business Intelligence & Data Analytics track at Carnegie Mellon. I became interested in the steps between a raw dataset and a result someone can use: cleaning the data, building a repeatable workflow, checking the output, and explaining what it means.</p>
      <p>At University Health Services, I worked with clinical systems and EHR workflows, writing SQL reports for non-technical stakeholders and automating data audits in Python under HIPAA requirements. As a research analyst for a faculty-sponsored project, I built ETL pipelines across 500+ public data sources, ran hypothesis tests in R, and documented the workflow so others could take it over. My independent projects include cloud data pipelines on AWS, an end-to-end e-commerce analytics stack in BigQuery, dbt, and Tableau, and image classification with PyTorch.</p>
      <p>I'm focused on analytics engineering, data engineering, and health informatics roles. I want to keep building data systems that are reliable and useful, and to be clear about what the data does and does not show.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="education-section section-shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">EDUCATION</p>
    <article class="education-row">
      <div class="mono muted">2026 - 2027</div>
      <div><h2>Carnegie Mellon University, Heinz College</h2><p>Master of Information Systems Management · Business Intelligence & Data Analytics</p></div>
    </article>
    <article class="education-row">
      <div class="mono muted">2022 - 2026</div>
      <div><h2>University of Wisconsin-Madison</h2><p>Bachelor of Business Administration · Information Systems and Data Science · Graduated with Distinction, Dean's List all 8 semesters</p></div>
    </article>
    <p class="small-note">Selected coursework includes data engineering, intermediate database management, NoSQL data management, A/B testing and experimentation, statistics, and machine learning.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="education-section section-shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">HOW I LIKE TO WORK</p>
    <div class="principles-grid">
      <article><span class="mono">01</span><h3>Make it dependable</h3><p>Data quality, clear assumptions, and repeatable workflows are part of the solution, not afterthoughts.</p></article>
      <article><span class="mono">02</span><h3>Explain the why</h3><p>I try to connect methods and metrics to the question someone actually needs answered.</p></article>
      <article><span class="mono">03</span><h3>Stay curious</h3><p>I like learning across infrastructure, analytics, and modeling rather than treating them as isolated disciplines.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
